# Ertha Jo, Frontier Mentor. Turn 1: it enters and makes a Mercenary token. Turn 3: the Mercenary's "{T}: Target creature you
# control gets +1/+0" targets Ertha Jo; Ertha Jo copies it and the copy is given a new target, Prodigal Sorcerer: each gets
# +1/+0. Prodigal Sorcerer's "{T}: 1 damage to any target" at Bot2 (a player) is copied too, keeping its target: Bot2 takes 2.
# The copies were not activated, so they copy nothing more. Then Strip Mine is sacrificed to destroy the Wasteland: that ability
# targets only a land, so Ertha Jo does not trigger (one item on the stack).

